      "nodes": [
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>We Do Things a Little Differently Here</p>",
          "transform": "uppercase",
          "id": "CwcaHUCPgM",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static",
          "hint": "kicker"
        },
        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Modern Vision Care with a Personal Touch",
          "html": "Modern Vision Care with a Personal Touch",
          "id": "79On8lQwyq",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>When you visit our <a href=\"/hours-location/\">Pine Beach eye clinic</a>, we don’t rush you through your appointment or treat you like a number on a schedule. We take the time to understand what’s going on with your eyes, answer your questions, and make sure you feel comfortable every step of the way.</p><p>With a mix of experience, modern technology, and a team that truly cares, you’ll get the kind of attention that’s hard to find just anywhere.</p>",
          "id": "25wfrYDLiK",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
