        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Supporting Your Family’s Vision at Every Age",
          "html": "Supporting Your Family’s Vision at Every Age",
          "id": "05pySoAM15",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>From a child’s first eye exam to helping adults stay ahead of changes in their vision, we’re here for every stage of life. Many of our patients come from Pine Beach, Beachwood, Toms River, and nearby communities, and a lot of them have been coming here for years.</p><p>It’s not unusual for us to see multiple generations of the same family, all in the same week. That’s the kind of place we’ve always been, and it’s something we’re proud to continue.</p>",
          "id": "h2Pftvsphy",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        }
      ]
    },
